  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scoping study Practical Agricultural Education Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This scoping study aims to identify the deficiencies in the agricultural education system in Ethiopia, with a particular focus on dairy, horticulture, and agricultural entrepreneurship. The study will help to develop a shared vision and plan of action to create a sustainable and practical educational program in Ethiopia. The program will substantially increase the number of practically trained Ethiopian agricultural graduates and workers in the dairy and horticulture sectors and agricultural entrepreneurship. This initiative will benefit all Dutch agricultural companies with activities in Ethiopia and contribute to private sector development.</narrative>
  </description>
